{"id":"wb-7-712","name":"文天祥祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"文天祥祠 (北京)","text":"文天祥祠，又称文丞相祠，位于中华人民共和国北京市东城区交道口街道府学胡同63号，是一处祭祀文天祥的祠庙，文天祥是南宋末期政治家、诗人、抗元人物和民族英雄。该祠庙始建于明朝洪武九年（1376年），原址为元代的兵马司狱。万历年间时，该祠庙曾有过搬迁，此后历代均有修缮。文天祥祠为两进院落结构，主要建筑为大门、过厅和享堂。2013年，文天祥祠被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%87%E5%A4%A9%E7%A5%A5%E7%A5%A0_(%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC)","revisionId":89192945,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89192945","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9f75994d31e221bba712f776.jpg","title":"Ancestral_Temple_for_Wen_Tianxiang_(20221031120711).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ancestral_Temple_for_Wen_Tianxiang_(20221031120711).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Ancestral_Temple_for_Wen_Tianxiang_%2820221031120711%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Passed by.","width":320,"height":213}}